         <description>
            <p>
               Image processing, imaging-target planning and subframe review tools for PixInsight. This package requires PixInsight 1.9.6 or later.
            </p>
            <p>
               Astro Bucket List 0.39.0 improves object editing, list management and Stellarium integration.
            </p>
            <p>
               Object types support predefined and custom classifications, plus re-evaluation using catalog information, descriptions and comments. SIMBAD lookups request full type descriptions, and 226 bundled definitions make saved abbreviations readable offline. Manual classifications and candidate status are preserved.
            </p>
            <p>
               The object editor includes an imaging date selector, a &quot;Use catalog identifier&quot; action for Display name, and compact RA/Dec fields with manual sexagesimal entry. Unchanged coordinates retain their original precision.
            </p>
            <p>
               List memberships can be edited directly, including membership in multiple lists. Adding from &quot;All objects&quot; requires an explicit destination choice. &quot;Selected only&quot; filters the table to checked objects.
            </p>
            <p>
               New Stellarium labels omit the unwanted &quot;marker&quot; suffix. Existing labels can be edited or repaired without losing catalog identity or duplicate detection. Find ignores hidden marker suffixes, and the optional coordinate-marker behavior is explained in the updated documentation.
            </p>
            <p>
               Astro Bucket List and Subframe Quality Review signatures have been updated for PixInsight 1.9.6 Lockhart Build 1718.
            </p>
            <p>
               Copyright (c) 2026 Dr. Thorsten Glebe. All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
</xri>
